# `vercel --prod` deploys the working directory as-is — it is not a git-based deploy, so
# `.gitignore` is not consulted here. `.data/` is this app's local disk-mode mock database and
# upload store (see src/server/mock/storage.ts); it must never ship with a deployment. It's
# gitignored precisely because it isn't source, and a stray copy sitting on disk when `vercel
# --prod` runs has no business becoming part of what a fresh Vercel Blob store reseeds from.
.data
